<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="kitControl-Hysteresis" xml:lang="en-us" class="- topic/topic       reference/reference "><title class="- topic/title ">kitControl-Hysteresis</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">This component transforms a numeric  input signal into a Boolean output. </shortdesc><prolog class="- topic/prolog "><author translate="no" type="creator" class="- topic/author ">Claudia Serwe &lt;claudia.serwe@tridium.com&gt;</author><metadata class="- topic/metadata "><keywords class="- topic/keywords "/></metadata></prolog><refbody class="- topic/body        reference/refbody "><section class="- topic/section ">
    
    <image placement="break" width="500" href="../graphic/kitControl-Hysteresis.png" class="- topic/image "/><p class="- topic/p ">It is performed under the following conditions:<ul class="- topic/ul "><li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">When the output is <systemoutput class="+ topic/ph sw-d/systemoutput ">false</systemoutput> and the input becomes greater than the property <parmname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/parmname ">In Low</parmname>, the
output switches to <systemoutput class="+ topic/ph sw-d/systemoutput ">true</systemoutput>.</p></li><li class="- topic/li "><p class="- topic/p ">When the output is <systemoutput class="+ topic/ph sw-d/systemoutput ">true</systemoutput> and the input becomes less than the parameter <parmname class="+ topic/keyword pr-d/parmname ">In Low</parmname>, the output
switches to <systemoutput class="+ topic/ph sw-d/systemoutput ">false</systemoutput>.<image placement="break" href="../graphic/kitControl-Hysteresis2.png" class="- topic/image "/></p></li></ul></p><p class="- topic/p ">Hysteresis is available in the <filepath class="+ topic/ph sw-d/filepath ">Logic</filepath> folder of the <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">kitControl</uicontrol> palette.</p>
    </section></refbody></reference>